  "description": "A .NET C# library for integrating multiple third-party payment gateways into your application. This library provides a unified interface to interact with payment services such as Paymob, Stripe, Taps, MyFatoorah, Fawaterak, Moyasar, Kashier, PayPal, Tabby, and Tamara, enabling seamless payment processing, invoice detail retrieval, and connection health checks. Supports Buy Now Pay Later (BNPL) payments through Tabby and Tamara for GCC region.",
